WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 24=

22
02:02.241 --> 02:03.601
Time flies. You're all grown up.

23
02:04.081 --> 02:05.161
You can make your own

24
02:05.161 --> 02:05.721
decisions now.

25
02:06.881 --> 02:07.760
I'm not really needed.

26
02:12.920 --> 02:13.721
I am grown up.

27
02:14.311 --> 02:14.841
I can see things clearly

28
02:14.841 --> 02:16.161
and tell right from wrong.

29
02:17.121 --> 02:17.480
Dad,

30
02:17.920 --> 02:18.960
I'm truly grateful

31
02:19.041 --> 02:19.920
for everything

32
02:19.920 --> 02:20.480
these years.

33
02:20.920 --> 02:21.621
But some mistakes

34
02:22.001 --> 02:23.080
can't be undone.

35
02:24.080 --> 02:24.601
Stop now.

36
02:25.084 --> 02:26.313
Don't let this go any further.

37
02:26.920 --> 02:27.881
I did nothing wrong.

38
02:29.200 --> 02:29.881
I built Jiali

39
02:29.960 --> 02:30.721
with my own hands.

40
02:31.240 --> 02:32.480
Taking the money I deserve

41
02:32.841 --> 02:33.520
is only fair.

42
02:33.760 --> 02:34.360
What about Mom?

43
02:35.200 --> 02:36.487
Don't you fear implicating her?

44
02:39.640 --> 02:40.480
I won't fail.

45
02:40.721 --> 02:41.760
I won't wish you luck.

46
02:52.057 --> 02:55.552
(Dad, Block)

47
03:07.561 --> 03:07.960
Mom.

48
03:11.680 --> 03:12.121
Sorry,

49
03:12.161 --> 03:13.200
I got the wrong room.

50
03:14.441 --> 03:15.281
I'm your mother.

51
03:23.680 --> 03:24.240
Mom,

52
03:24.561 --> 03:25.240
you scared me

53
03:25.240 --> 03:25.853
half to death.

54
03:27.321 --> 03:28.121
Are you okay?

55
03:29.881 --> 03:30.640
Just kidding.

56
03:30.960 --> 03:32.760
You little brat, really.

57
03:34.001 --> 03:34.441
Mom,

58
03:34.960 --> 03:35.920
so you're just

59
03:36.001 --> 03:36.920
leaving for good?

60
03:38.281 --> 03:39.800
I'm leaving in the next couple of days

61
03:40.441 --> 03:41.321
to get settled in.

62
03:41.680 --> 03:42.080
Fine.

63
03:42.558 --> 03:43.295
Whatever you say.

64
03:47.520 --> 03:48.401
Why pack all this?

65
03:48.520 --> 03:48.960
Chinese supermarkets

66
03:49.001 --> 03:50.080
overseas have them all.

67
03:50.441 --> 03:51.920
They won't have everything I've got.

68
03:51.960 --> 03:52.601
Let me tell you.

69
03:53.001 --> 03:53.920
I can't stomach Western

70
03:53.960 --> 03:54.656
fast food at all.

71
03:56.601 --> 03:57.800
What

72
03:57.960 --> 03:58.920
is this, then?

73
04:00.800 --> 04:01.321
Moxa sticks.

74
04:01.680 --> 04:02.401
For moxibustion.

75
04:03.001 --> 04:03.960
Whenever you have

76
04:04.321 --> 04:05.360
a fever, a headache,

77
04:05.760 --> 04:06.601
or back pain,

78
04:06.841 --> 04:07.520
just use moxa,

79
04:07.800 --> 04:08.603
and you'll be fine.

80
04:09.200 --> 04:09.640
Speaking of which,

81
04:09.640 --> 04:10.281
I wanted to ask,

82
04:10.281 --> 04:11.601
will my nursing license

83
04:12.080 --> 04:13.121
work abroad?

84
04:13.561 --> 04:14.760
You'd have to pass

85
04:14.841 --> 04:16.440
their local nursing exam first.

86
04:16.920 --> 04:17.360
But Mom,

87
04:17.480 --> 04:18.480
we're going abroad.

88
04:18.761 --> 04:19.560
Still be a nurse?

89
04:20.401 --> 04:22.161
How about we open

90
04:23.240 --> 04:24.440
a massage therapy clinic?

91
04:25.081 --> 04:26.521
If you run it,

92
04:26.560 --> 04:28.201
we'll have a whole chain.

93
04:29.281 --> 04:29.961
Harry,

94
04:30.641 --> 04:31.920
I can't do big business like that.

95
04:31.920 --> 04:33.081
At most, I'd just open

96
04:33.920 --> 04:35.560
a small clinic in the neighborhood.

97
04:35.721 --> 04:37.240
And if things go well,

98
04:37.680 --> 04:38.440
I'll hire help.

99
04:38.601 --> 04:39.401
If not,

100
04:39.680 --> 04:40.601
I'll run it myself.

101
04:41.440 --> 04:42.920
I just close up shop at night.

102
04:43.201 --> 04:44.480
On holidays,

103
04:44.841 --> 04:46.601
I'll go to the beach,

104
04:47.161 --> 04:48.440
find a lounge chair,

105
04:49.440 --> 04:50.480
enjoy the sea breeze,

106
04:50.800 --> 04:51.641
and soak up the sun.

107
04:53.360 --> 04:53.680
Okay.

108
04:53.920 --> 04:54.560
And I

109
04:54.680 --> 04:55.680
will be right there

110
04:55.761 --> 04:57.081
as your personal photographer.

111
04:57.201 --> 04:58.401
Click, click, click,

112
04:58.721 --> 05:00.000
taking shots of you. How's that?

113
05:00.201 --> 05:00.961
Hearing that,

114
05:01.360 --> 05:02.521
I'd better practice

115
05:03.240 --> 05:04.920
some more poses.

116
05:05.521 --> 05:06.961
But if they don't turn out well,

117
05:07.680 --> 05:08.680
it's entirely your fault.

118
05:09.641 --> 05:10.201
Yes, Ma'am.

119
05:13.680 --> 05:14.601
I should dress plainly.

120
05:15.161 --> 05:15.721
This looks nice.

121
05:20.000 --> 05:20.521
(Meng,)

122
05:20.800 --> 05:21.880
(I need to talk to you.)

123
05:22.360 --> 05:23.554
(Can we meet sometime soon?)

124
05:31.880 --> 05:32.560
(Of course.)

125
05:36.142 --> 05:38.934
(From Lu Hui, To Di Liren)

126
05:50.721 --> 05:51.524
Property management?

127
05:52.120 --> 05:53.201
I'm the owner of Unit 3901.

128
05:54.196 --> 05:55.201
Some unwanted large items

129
05:55.201 --> 05:56.201
are left at our doorstep.

130
05:56.841 --> 05:57.961
Please clear them away.

131
05:58.240 --> 05:59.161
Sure, right away.

132
06:01.081 --> 06:01.961
Sir, your package.

133
06:09.922 --> 06:11.393
(From Yu Meng, To Di Liren)

134
06:59.281 --> 06:59.680
Hello.

135
07:01.081 --> 07:01.721
Can I help you?

136
07:02.560 --> 07:03.401
Offices are closed.

137
07:03.800 --> 07:04.601
Without a badge,

138
07:04.721 --> 07:05.201
you need to apply

139
07:05.201 --> 07:06.041
with the company rep

140
07:06.081 --> 07:06.841
to get access.

141
07:09.746 --> 07:13.306
(Di Liren, Chairman Four years ago, Jiangzhou)

142
07:16.417 --> 07:17.592
(Proposal to Restructure Jiali and Establish Three Core Departments)

143
07:24.537 --> 07:25.488
New product's sold out.

144
07:25.721 --> 07:27.081
Ramp up production, now.

145
07:27.628 --> 07:30.033
(Jiangzhou Business Leader)

146
07:30.120 --> 07:31.920
(This chair is mine now.)

147
07:32.320 --> 07:33.440
(And your seat as Chairman)

148
07:33.440 --> 07:33.761
(is mine too.)

149
07:33.761 --> 07:34.743
(Taking the money I deserve)

150
07:34.800 --> 07:35.521
(is only fair.)

151
07:35.521 --> 07:36.250
(What about Mom?)

152
07:36.841 --> 07:38.217
(Don't you fear implicating her?)

153
07:38.440 --> 07:39.401
(I want nothing of you)

154
07:39.401 --> 07:40.201
(around me.)

155
07:40.201 --> 07:41.120
(Pack up all your things)

156
07:41.120 --> 07:41.680
(from the villa)

157
07:41.680 --> 07:42.281
(and get out.)

158
07:42.281 --> 07:43.041
(Never come back.)

159
07:43.041 --> 07:43.721
(I won't lose.)

160
07:43.903 --> 07:44.961
(I gave the chairman role)

161
07:44.961 --> 07:45.480
(back to Yu Meng.)

162
07:45.480 --> 07:46.480
(I won't wish you luck.)

163
07:46.480 --> 07:47.081
(Now, Jiali)

164
07:47.081 --> 07:48.201
(has nothing to do with me.)

165
07:48.360 --> 07:49.281
(I have nothing left.)

166
08:09.201 --> 08:09.641
Mr. Sun.

167
08:12.800 --> 08:13.281
Mr. Di.

168
08:13.641 --> 08:14.240
I've put up

169
08:14.320 --> 08:15.081
some life tips

170
08:15.440 --> 08:16.401
on the fridge.

171
08:16.920 --> 08:17.721
Please remind Meng

172
08:18.081 --> 08:18.680
to take a look.

173
08:20.401 --> 08:21.641
Where are you heading?

174
08:22.559 --> 08:23.158
Business trip.

175
08:23.601 --> 08:24.880
It'll be a long one this time.

176
08:25.360 --> 08:26.065
While I'm away,

177
08:26.120 --> 08:26.761
look after Meng

178
08:26.841 --> 08:28.000
for me please, Mr. Sun.

179
08:35.121 --> 08:36.080
Sir, why?

180
08:37.680 --> 08:39.361
This is a reward for spotting that fire

181
08:39.680 --> 08:40.521
and putting it out.

182
08:41.041 --> 08:41.361
Wait.

183
08:41.680 --> 08:43.080
This is far too much...

184
08:43.440 --> 08:44.320
Safety comes first.

185
08:45.080 --> 08:45.840
If Meng knew

186
08:45.840 --> 08:46.680
about the fire,

187
08:47.241 --> 08:48.241
she would

188
08:48.440 --> 08:49.121
reward you more.

189
08:49.641 --> 08:50.200
She's valued

190
08:50.361 --> 08:51.680
the family's health and safety

191
08:51.800 --> 08:52.720
above everything else.

192
08:53.320 --> 08:53.761
By the way,

193
08:54.320 --> 08:55.281
over by the kitchen,

194
08:55.401 --> 08:56.481
there's a wiring fault

195
08:57.080 --> 08:58.560
that frequently sparks.

196
08:59.057 --> 09:00.361
Property management came once,

197
09:00.361 --> 09:01.320
but it's acting up again.

198
09:01.320 --> 09:01.800
I asked them

199
09:01.840 --> 09:02.873
to come again tomorrow.

200
09:03.560 --> 09:04.521
Please supervise them

201
09:05.080 --> 09:06.680
and make sure it's completely fixed.

202
09:07.121 --> 09:08.361
Otherwise, it's too dangerous.

203
09:10.641 --> 09:11.161
No problem.

204
09:11.369 --> 09:12.417
Alright, I won't keep you.

205
09:24.868 --> 09:29.855
(Lu Lizhen)

206
09:31.840 --> 09:32.241
Mom,

207
09:33.881 --> 09:35.361
Meng insists on divorcing me

208
09:36.281 --> 09:37.401
and wants me out of here.

209
09:38.281 --> 09:39.121
I'm leaving today.

210
09:40.022 --> 09:40.931
I called to tell you.

211
09:41.155 --> 09:42.121
Thank you for your care

212
09:42.121 --> 09:42.920
all these years.

213
09:58.560 --> 09:58.920
Mom.

214
10:00.320 --> 10:00.840
Meng,

215
10:02.641 --> 10:04.241
are you really getting a divorce?

216
10:09.720 --> 10:11.641
I'm ready to let everything go

217
10:12.001 --> 10:12.720
and start fresh.

218
10:13.241 --> 10:14.680
Over the next few days,

219
10:14.789 --> 10:15.720
I'll pack up his things

220
10:15.720 --> 10:16.641
and send them away.

221
10:16.881 --> 10:18.080
Today is the last time

222
10:18.200 --> 10:19.401
he'll step foot in our home.

223
10:20.001 --> 10:21.241
After this, he won't have

224
10:21.680 --> 10:23.080
anything to do with us.

225
10:29.320 --> 10:30.121
What's wrong, Mom?

226
10:32.840 --> 10:33.840
Don't worry.

227
10:34.481 --> 10:35.720
Even after the divorce,

228
10:36.001 --> 10:36.641
I'll make sure

229
10:36.720 --> 10:37.800
to live my life well

230
10:37.881 --> 10:39.041
and run the company properly.

231
10:39.600 --> 10:40.080
Look.

232
10:40.680 --> 10:41.680
I've already started

233
10:41.800 --> 10:43.080
preparing for a new company.

234
10:43.560 --> 10:44.641
Scouting locations,

235
10:44.761 --> 10:46.641
deciding on our business direction...

236
10:47.041 --> 10:47.920
I got my hands full.

237
10:48.600 --> 10:49.800
I am just happy for you.

238
10:50.720 --> 10:51.440
My daughter

239
10:51.920 --> 10:53.320
is finally free from the misery.

240
10:54.361 --> 10:54.995
Come sit here.

241
10:56.320 --> 10:57.281
You scared me.

242
10:58.440 --> 10:59.320
I thought

243
10:59.600 --> 11:00.840
you didn't support my divorce.

244
11:01.200 --> 11:02.800
After your dad's serious illness,

245
11:03.521 --> 11:04.800
I finally realized

246
11:05.920 --> 11:07.680
nothing in life truly matters

247
11:08.481 --> 11:09.401
except life and death.

248
11:11.080 --> 11:12.641
Life is short, after all.

249
11:13.401 --> 11:14.320
We should save our time

250
11:15.001 --> 11:16.121
for what and who

251
11:16.401 --> 11:17.200
truly deserves it.

252
11:20.200 --> 11:20.840
By the way, Mom,

253
11:21.560 --> 11:22.881
after the divorce,

254
11:23.161 --> 11:24.200
let's go do

255
11:24.481 --> 11:25.281
a photoshoot.

256
11:25.881 --> 11:26.440
We can capture

257
11:26.560 --> 11:28.481
the fresh start of my new life.

258
11:28.680 --> 11:29.200
How's that?

259
11:29.960 --> 11:31.241
Let's do traditional costumes.

260
11:32.041 --> 11:33.320
I'm sick of modern shoots.

261
11:34.521 --> 11:34.960
Sure.

262
11:35.080 --> 11:36.361
Whether it's Hanfu, Tang suits,

263
11:36.440 --> 11:37.241
or pleated skirts,

264
11:37.600 --> 11:38.440
it's all up to you.

265
11:40.107 --> 11:41.197
Alright, you must be tired.

266
11:42.001 --> 11:42.600
Rest early.

267
11:43.361 --> 11:44.440
It's fine. You go first.

268
11:44.607 --> 11:45.472
I'll work for a bit longer.

269
11:47.281 --> 11:47.791
Good night.

270
11:48.001 --> 11:48.540
Good night.

271
11:48.920 --> 11:49.920
Don't stay up too late.

272
12:29.521 --> 12:30.481
Why so much smoke here?

273
12:32.281 --> 12:32.680
Mom!

274
12:35.440 --> 12:36.281
Why is it on fire?

275
12:36.840 --> 12:37.361
Mom!

276
12:41.680 --> 12:42.121
Mom!

277
12:42.600 --> 12:43.041
Mom!

278
12:44.241 --> 12:44.800
Mom!

279
12:45.440 --> 12:45.840
Mom!

280
12:46.241 --> 12:47.600
Mom! Mom!

281
12:48.080 --> 12:48.481
Mom!

282
12:48.761 --> 12:49.481
Wake up, Mom!

283
14:13.521 --> 14:14.720
It's all over.

284
14:15.720 --> 14:16.560
Put out the fire!

285
14:21.001 --> 14:21.560
Meng!

286
14:22.241 --> 14:22.641
Meng!

287
14:23.521 --> 14:24.417
- You can't go in! - Don't go in!

288
14:24.641 --> 14:25.680
- It's dangerous! - Don't go in!

289
14:25.966 --> 14:26.661
You can't go in!

290
14:27.281 --> 14:28.641
- It's dangerous! Get back! - Come back!

291
14:30.560 --> 14:31.761
Hurry, throw some water!

292
14:39.248 --> 14:40.911
(Ambulance)

293
14:44.704 --> 14:49.725
(Emergency)

294
14:49.761 --> 14:50.161
Haoyu!

295
14:51.080 --> 14:51.440
Haoyu!

296
14:51.521 --> 14:52.881
Open your eyes and look at me!

297
14:53.481 --> 14:54.041
Haoyu!

298
14:57.281 --> 14:57.920
Haoyu!

299
15:11.174 --> 15:14.711
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

300
15:16.716 --> 15:20.296
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

301
15:20.296 --> 15:23.578
(ICU)

302
15:23.578 --> 15:26.533
♪I fall into the abyss♪

303
15:33.531 --> 15:36.835
♪Shadows torn apart by moonlight♪

304
15:38.923 --> 15:42.824
♪Shards can't piece together tomorrow♪

305
15:42.824 --> 15:44.720
♪You set gentle traps♪

306
15:44.720 --> 15:45.440
Where's Haoyu?

307
15:46.646 --> 15:47.200
You're awake.

308
15:47.200 --> 15:47.560
Haoyu...

309
15:48.401 --> 15:48.840
Haoyu...

310
15:49.680 --> 15:50.080
Ms. Hui,

311
15:50.761 --> 15:51.521
he just had surgery

312
15:51.960 --> 15:52.920
and is out of danger.

313
15:53.281 --> 15:54.200
But no visitors yet.

314
15:54.440 --> 15:55.840
It was all to save you!

315
15:56.960 --> 15:58.600
That's why Haoyu got burned like this.

316
15:59.401 --> 16:01.080
Why are you completely fine

317
16:01.361 --> 16:03.401
while my son got burned so badly?

318
16:04.161 --> 16:04.641
I'm sorry...

319
16:05.161 --> 16:06.361
Did you see his injuries?

320
16:06.440 --> 16:07.361
Did you smell his flesh

321
16:07.361 --> 16:08.960
charred from the fire?

322
16:09.200 --> 16:10.881
The one lying in there right now

323
16:12.320 --> 16:13.281
should be you!

324
16:13.560 --> 16:14.200
You!

325
16:14.960 --> 16:16.320
Why did you drag him into this

326
16:16.401 --> 16:17.287
in the first place?

327
16:17.641 --> 16:18.481
Why?

328
16:18.600 --> 16:19.281
We were supposed

329
16:19.800 --> 16:20.680
to go abroad

330
16:20.680 --> 16:22.041
and start a new life!

331
16:22.121 --> 16:23.960
Why did this have to happen

332
16:24.001 --> 16:25.080
right now?

333
16:25.800 --> 16:26.920
Why?

334
16:27.680 --> 16:28.960
Why?

335
16:28.960 --> 16:32.469
♪Cigarette glows like an epitaph♪

336
16:32.469 --> 16:34.729
♪The footnotes you left♪

337
16:35.295 --> 16:37.977
♪Are all plagiarized♪

338
16:45.312 --> 16:48.671
♪A stranger in the mirror♪

339
16:50.811 --> 16:54.482
♪Gaze colder than a blade♪

340
16:55.560 --> 16:57.680
My poor boy...

341
16:59.641 --> 17:01.281
He just stepped out for a bit.

342
17:03.320 --> 17:04.400
How did he end up

343
17:04.521 --> 17:08.080
like this?

344
17:08.883 --> 17:11.267
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

345
17:11.267 --> 17:13.481
♪Just an empty shell♪

346
17:13.481 --> 17:14.481
I thought

347
17:15.761 --> 17:18.080
I'd finally made it to the good life.

348
17:19.120 --> 17:20.761
God, why are you so blind?

349
17:22.640 --> 17:24.241
Even if my life is worthless,

350
17:25.080 --> 17:27.761
did you really have to torment me like this?

351
17:35.019 --> 17:37.751
♪For the part you owe me♪

352
17:37.751 --> 17:40.754
♪I'll make you pay double♪

353
17:54.281 --> 17:54.640
Doctor,

354
17:55.041 --> 17:56.168
which ward is Fang Haoyu in?

355
17:56.721 --> 17:57.840
Family, sign at the desk.

356
17:58.560 --> 17:58.880
Okay.

357
18:02.201 --> 18:03.080
I'm Fang Haoyu's dad.

358
18:03.721 --> 18:04.579
Which ward is he in?

359
18:04.761 --> 18:05.477
Let me see him.

360
18:07.800 --> 18:08.840
He has full-body burns

361
18:09.001 --> 18:09.921
with airway damage.

362
18:10.080 --> 18:10.880
He's still in a coma

363
18:11.201 --> 18:12.560
and needs to be kept in isolation

364
18:12.640 --> 18:13.418
in a sterile ward.

365
18:14.681 --> 18:15.201
I'm sorry.

366
18:15.721 --> 18:17.080
His guardian requested

367
18:17.281 --> 18:18.241
no visitors at all.

368
18:19.160 --> 18:21.840
Will his face be permanently scarred?

369
18:22.241 --> 18:23.080
It's too early

370
18:23.201 --> 18:24.201
to say right now.

371
18:24.400 --> 18:25.320
Our top priority now

372
18:25.481 --> 18:26.441
is infection control.

373
18:52.281 --> 18:53.761
It's my fault.

374
18:57.880 --> 18:59.400
I did this to him.

375
18:59.400 --> 19:04.405
(Inpatient Building)

376
19:23.241 --> 19:24.600
Bear with it. It might hurt a bit.

377
19:31.241 --> 19:32.281
It must have been him.

378
19:32.721 --> 19:34.201
Your gardener, Mr. Sun, set the fire.

379
19:34.579 --> 19:35.560
He owed a fortune to loan sharks

380
19:35.560 --> 19:36.385
and couldn't repay.

381
19:36.800 --> 19:37.800
So he took a risk,

382
19:38.041 --> 19:39.201
using your bad wiring

383
19:39.281 --> 19:40.521
to set a fire, put it out,

384
19:40.961 --> 19:41.721
and claim credit

385
19:41.800 --> 19:43.120
for a reward to clear his debts.

386
19:46.481 --> 19:47.880
But the fire got out of control.

387
19:49.160 --> 19:50.120
Scared out of his wits,

388
19:50.120 --> 19:50.961
he turned himself in.

389
19:53.360 --> 19:54.880
It had to be him. It was Di Liren!

390
19:55.160 --> 19:56.001
How could there be

391
19:56.041 --> 19:56.961
such a coincidence?

392
19:57.481 --> 19:58.294
Right after he left,

393
19:58.441 --> 19:59.160
the fire started.

394
20:01.360 --> 20:02.640
After investigating the scene,

395
20:03.001 --> 20:04.320
it was really Mr. Sun who set it.

396
20:05.681 --> 20:07.041
The testimonies all match up.

397
20:07.320 --> 20:07.961
Knowing

398
20:08.041 --> 20:09.120
how meticulous Di Liren is,

399
20:09.281 --> 20:10.521
he wouldn't have left

400
20:10.640 --> 20:11.721
any substantial evidence.

401
20:11.880 --> 20:13.241
At most, just verbal inducement.

402
20:13.761 --> 20:14.600
Can't pin it on him.

403
20:22.400 --> 20:22.961
What's wrong?

404
20:26.120 --> 20:26.840
He's planned

405
20:26.921 --> 20:27.721
a murder twice now.

406
20:28.521 --> 20:29.521
people around me

407
20:29.640 --> 20:30.921
can't be this lucky every time.

408
20:40.201 --> 20:41.087
I've figured it out.

409
20:42.921 --> 20:43.800
I know what to do.

410
20:44.880 --> 20:46.080
We need to gather evidence.

411
20:46.560 --> 20:47.201
I can't let him

412
20:47.201 --> 20:48.201
hurt anyone close to me.

413
20:48.880 --> 20:49.441
Keep him calm.

414
20:49.481 --> 20:50.599
Get him to agree to divorce.

415
20:51.201 --> 20:51.892
Everything else

416
20:52.201 --> 20:52.921
can wait.

417
20:55.080 --> 20:55.814
You're giving up?

418
20:57.921 --> 20:58.840
I'm not giving up.

419
20:59.921 --> 21:00.560
I need to ensure

420
21:00.640 --> 21:01.600
those around me are safe

421
21:01.921 --> 21:02.954
and can't be used by him.

422
21:04.160 --> 21:04.840
I'll settle it

423
21:06.360 --> 21:07.481
with him when the divorce

424
21:07.961 --> 21:08.921
is finalized.

425
21:11.041 --> 21:11.481
All right.

426
21:12.201 --> 21:12.840
I understand.

427
21:14.001 --> 21:15.481
Di Liren is targeting you

428
21:15.640 --> 21:16.441
because he wants

429
21:16.521 --> 21:17.201
Jiali's shares.

430
21:18.041 --> 21:18.640
As long as you're willing

431
21:18.640 --> 21:19.721
to transfer your shares,

432
21:19.721 --> 21:21.160
I'm confident I can get him to sign.

433
21:27.400 --> 21:28.761
Jinghua is on the right track now,

434
21:29.160 --> 21:31.761
and Ding and the others got their bonuses.

435
21:32.840 --> 21:34.041
Nothing is holding me back.

436
21:36.120 --> 21:37.560
And after all these years, Jiali

437
21:37.961 --> 21:39.400
has been hollowed out by Di Liren.

438
21:39.481 --> 21:41.080
Instead of endlessly

439
21:41.241 --> 21:42.481
filling this bottomless pit,

440
21:43.320 --> 21:44.281
I'd rather take Haomeng

441
21:44.400 --> 21:45.160
and start over.

442
21:50.681 --> 21:51.120
But Jiali

443
21:51.241 --> 21:52.320
is my parents' life's work.

444
21:53.400 --> 21:54.761
I need to discuss it with my mom

445
21:55.921 --> 21:56.761
after she wakes up.

446
22:02.259 --> 22:03.120
But Harry transferred

447
22:03.120 --> 22:04.441
the funds under your name.

448
22:04.717 --> 22:05.721
Does Di Liren have money

449
22:05.721 --> 22:06.705
to buy back the shares?

450
22:08.400 --> 22:08.921
He does.

451
22:10.441 --> 22:11.761
Weng Yue told me before

452
22:12.681 --> 22:14.001
that Han Guang went to prison,

453
22:14.681 --> 22:15.441
but his overseas

454
22:15.521 --> 22:16.320
fixed assets

455
22:16.761 --> 22:18.441
have been heavily liquidated lately.

456
22:19.320 --> 22:20.800
Tell me. Who else could it be

457
22:21.521 --> 22:22.201
besides him?

458
22:23.400 --> 22:24.320
So Di Liren

459
22:24.481 --> 22:26.145
has been preparing for a share buyback.

460
22:29.001 --> 22:29.360
Alright.

461
22:29.896 --> 22:30.640
I'll settle the divorce

462
22:30.640 --> 22:31.481
with Di Liren's lawyer

463
22:31.481 --> 22:32.400
as soon as possible.

464
22:34.961 --> 22:35.320
Okay.

465
22:37.840 --> 22:38.564
It's almost dawn.

466
22:39.160 --> 22:40.466
I'll buy coffee and breakfast.

467
22:56.441 --> 22:56.840
Mom.

468
22:57.840 --> 22:58.560
You're awake, Mom.

469
23:00.840 --> 23:02.681
If he wants Jiali's shares,

470
23:04.080 --> 23:05.600
just give them to him.

471
23:07.921 --> 23:08.840
I heard it all?

472
23:09.400 --> 23:10.961
They're bent

473
23:11.880 --> 23:13.400
on devouring our family.

474
23:14.921 --> 23:16.560
Di Liren targeted you,

475
23:17.640 --> 23:19.160
and Lu Hui targeted your dad.

476
23:23.640 --> 23:25.160
Your dad lost his mind

477
23:25.681 --> 23:27.880
and actually wired Lu Hui money.

478
23:29.120 --> 23:30.681
I only found out recently.

479
23:31.840 --> 23:32.921
It made me so furious

480
23:33.761 --> 23:34.281
that I...

481
23:37.880 --> 23:39.001
Never mind. Forget it.

482
23:41.001 --> 23:42.800
Dad wired money to Lu Hui?

483
23:43.800 --> 23:45.136
Why did Lu Hui never mention it?

484
23:45.560 --> 23:46.441
Forget it.

485
23:47.681 --> 23:48.880
Those two

486
23:49.521 --> 23:50.880
are ruthless.

487
23:52.600 --> 23:53.921
When backed into a corner,

488
23:55.320 --> 23:56.521
the one with more to lose

489
23:57.320 --> 23:58.441
should give way first.

490
24:06.800 --> 24:07.360
Meng,

491
24:07.800 --> 24:08.800
thank you so much.

492
24:09.241 --> 24:10.080
You come all the way

493
24:10.201 --> 24:11.360
just to handle the handover.

494
24:12.120 --> 24:13.360
You're sure you don't need me

495
24:13.481 --> 24:14.320
to mail the things

496
24:14.360 --> 24:15.061
from your office?

497
24:15.521 --> 24:15.961
No need.

498
24:16.400 --> 24:17.041
Throw them away.

499
24:17.481 --> 24:17.840
Okay.

500
24:18.041 --> 24:18.930
I'll go upstairs then.

501
24:19.201 --> 24:20.138
Take care getting back.

502
24:20.560 --> 24:21.036
Thank you.

503
24:22.360 --> 24:23.640
I already told you.

504
24:23.961 --> 24:24.560
I'm looking

505
24:24.640 --> 24:25.840
for Di Liren, the Chairman

506
24:25.880 --> 24:26.668
of Jiali Cosmetics!

507
24:26.721 --> 24:27.681
Let me up right now!

508
24:27.961 --> 24:28.360
Sir,

509
24:28.441 --> 24:29.360
it's building policy.

510
24:29.600 --> 24:30.921
You'll need an employee badge

511
24:31.041 --> 24:32.375
or an invitation code to go up.

512
24:32.921 --> 24:34.256
Fine, Di Liren will fill you in.

513
24:34.961 --> 24:35.721
I'm so sorry.

514
24:36.001 --> 24:36.800
Ms. Yu, right?

515
24:37.481 --> 24:37.840
Hello.

516
24:38.320 --> 24:39.681
We're from Wuyou Moving Company.

517
24:40.120 --> 24:41.160
Glad to be of service.

518
24:56.041 --> 24:57.001
Dodging me, huh?

519
24:57.721 --> 24:58.521
Just you wait.

520
24:59.560 --> 25:00.521
You too!

521
25:26.481 --> 25:27.437
Look into this person.

522
25:33.721 --> 25:34.600
How's your hand?

523
25:39.041 --> 25:40.761
Mr. Sun really lost his mind.

524
25:41.360 --> 25:42.640
He actually did such a thing!

525
25:43.201 --> 25:44.400
Did Mr. Sun lose his mind,

526
25:45.400 --> 25:46.600
or are you just that sly?

527
25:48.201 --> 25:49.800
You used others to do your dirty work.

528
25:50.640 --> 25:51.761
You're truly vicious.

529
25:52.120 --> 25:53.281
I don't get it.

530
25:54.840 --> 25:55.721
Mr. Sun broke the law

531
25:55.880 --> 25:57.560
and committed arson.

532
25:57.880 --> 25:59.001
He's already been charged,

533
25:59.681 --> 26:00.400
facing at least

534
26:00.441 --> 26:01.640
three years in prison.

535
26:01.961 --> 26:03.041
Mr. Sun set the fire.

536
26:03.400 --> 26:04.041
No doubt.

537
26:05.001 --> 26:06.001
He's going to prison.

538
26:06.560 --> 26:07.681
It's set in stone.

539
26:07.800 --> 26:09.160
You're set in stone too.

540
26:10.320 --> 26:10.840
Don't rush.

541
26:11.761 --> 26:12.681
Your turn is coming.

542
26:13.201 --> 26:14.041
The fire really

543
26:14.160 --> 26:15.241
had nothing to do with me.

544
26:15.560 --> 26:16.600
Even if you suspect me

545
26:16.880 --> 26:17.600
and hate me,

546
26:18.001 --> 26:19.481
I never wanted to divorce you.

547
26:20.223 --> 26:21.400
This is the divorce agreement

548
26:21.400 --> 26:22.681
drafted by our lawyers.

549
26:24.241 --> 26:24.721
First,

550
26:25.600 --> 26:26.880
I'll transfer all my shares

551
26:27.560 --> 26:28.441
at Jiali to you.

552
26:29.640 --> 26:30.718
You'll buy at market price.

553
26:32.800 --> 26:33.281
Second,

554
26:34.320 --> 26:35.721
you can buy the penthouse you're in

555
26:37.001 --> 26:37.880
at a discount.

556
26:38.673 --> 26:39.781
(Yu Meng)

557
26:43.596 --> 26:44.667
(Di Liren)

558
27:14.080 --> 27:14.600
Third,

559
27:15.400 --> 27:16.320
I hope you will never

560
27:17.120 --> 27:18.001
bother me again.

561
27:18.416 --> 27:19.784
For work handover,

562
27:19.987 --> 27:21.227
have Zhang Tao contact me.

563
27:22.232 --> 27:23.578
Seeing you makes me nauseous.

564
27:29.441 --> 27:29.800
Meng.

565
27:32.481 --> 27:32.880
What?

566
27:33.640 --> 27:34.521
Any objections

567
27:34.961 --> 27:35.681
to the terms?

568
27:36.241 --> 27:36.640
No.

569
27:43.831 --> 27:44.640
If there's anything

570
27:44.640 --> 27:45.921
you need from me in the future,

571
27:47.540 --> 27:48.608
you can always come to me.

572
27:57.320 --> 27:57.921
Yong,

573
27:58.961 --> 27:59.560
let's meet.

574
28:10.640 --> 28:11.309
Congratulations.

575
28:11.704 --> 28:13.201
Once you get the divorce certificate,

576
28:13.201 --> 28:14.360
you'll be truly free.

577
28:15.721 --> 28:17.441
How thoughtful of you, Mr. Jiao.

578
28:18.441 --> 28:19.120
These flowers

579
28:19.681 --> 28:20.840
aren't pay-to-view, are they?

580
28:22.481 --> 28:23.481
These are a gift for you.

581
28:24.080 --> 28:26.120
Here's to a brand-new life.

582
28:29.761 --> 28:30.160
Thanks.

583
28:41.266 --> 28:41.800
Over here.

584
28:42.640 --> 28:43.201
Come on.

585
28:45.327 --> 28:45.957
Come over here.

586
28:47.400 --> 28:47.961
Come sit down.

587
28:48.481 --> 28:48.880
Attaboy.

588
28:50.761 --> 28:51.201
Sit here.

589
28:52.481 --> 28:52.961
How is it?

590
28:53.560 --> 28:54.521
Nice place, huh?

591
29:05.800 --> 29:06.721
There you go.

592
29:09.427 --> 29:10.891
Isn't there a trash can down there?

593
29:11.320 --> 29:13.041
Trash cans are for other things.

594
29:16.201 --> 29:16.800
Come on.

595
29:18.241 --> 29:19.281
Back when we were punks

596
29:19.400 --> 29:20.120
in Xiaocheng,

597
29:20.241 --> 29:21.521
you weren't this picky.

598
29:22.281 --> 29:24.080
Still as vulgar as ever.

599
29:24.880 --> 29:25.400
These years,

600
29:25.400 --> 29:26.559
I've given you so much money.

601
29:27.560 --> 29:28.441
Where did it all go?

602
29:31.320 --> 29:32.961
Bought specially to see you.

603
29:33.681 --> 29:34.441
A renowned brand.

604
29:37.400 --> 29:38.320
Just to see me,

605
29:38.880 --> 29:40.041
you dressed all fancy.

606
29:41.521 --> 29:42.320
Out of cash again?

607
29:42.761 --> 29:43.640
You know.

608
29:44.521 --> 29:45.800
If I weren't out of cash,

609
29:46.560 --> 29:47.400
I wouldn't be

610
29:47.400 --> 29:48.437
disturbing you, Mr. Busy.

611
29:53.360 --> 29:53.880
But I don't

612
29:53.880 --> 29:54.999
want to give you money now.

613
29:56.640 --> 29:58.160
I gave you all that money.

614
29:58.600 --> 29:59.521
You gambled it away.

615
30:00.560 --> 30:02.001
I won't support a gambling addict.

616
30:02.241 --> 30:03.080
What gambling addict?

617
30:06.441 --> 30:07.241
I see your mouth

618
30:07.360 --> 30:08.840
is still as foul and sharp as ever.

619
30:09.360 --> 30:10.001
Listen up.

620
30:10.481 --> 30:10.921
You need

621
30:11.320 --> 30:12.201
to keep me happy.

622
30:12.840 --> 30:13.560
Or my mouth

623
30:13.681 --> 30:14.880
is going to start running.

624
30:15.721 --> 30:17.640
I could go find your trophy wife,

625
30:17.961 --> 30:19.400
or find your former wife,

626
30:19.800 --> 30:20.441
to have a talk.

627
30:21.120 --> 30:22.080
I'm getting divorced.

628
30:23.320 --> 30:24.201
Say whatever you want.

629
30:33.600 --> 30:34.160
All right.

630
30:34.921 --> 30:36.320
Then I'll go talk to Lu Hui.

631
30:38.681 --> 30:39.481
We can talk

632
30:39.560 --> 30:41.320
about how her father, Lu Zhiming, died.

633
30:45.681 --> 30:46.880
Wasn't it a car accident?

634
30:47.521 --> 30:48.640
Is there more to the story?

635
30:52.600 --> 30:54.201
Playing dumb with me, are you?

636
31:02.761 --> 31:03.800
You don't know

637
31:03.961 --> 31:04.921
how her dad died?

638
31:05.560 --> 31:07.001
I'll keep it simple.

639
31:07.360 --> 31:08.400
Pay up on time,

640
31:09.201 --> 31:10.201
and you will be fine.

641
31:11.600 --> 31:12.160
Otherwise,

642
31:18.481 --> 31:20.441
I'll make your life a living nightmare.

643
31:24.640 --> 31:26.201
Acting like you don't know...

644
31:40.309 --> 31:42.148
(Interbank Collection and Acceptance Receipt, Third Copy)

645
31:42.148 --> 31:43.400
(Xiaocheng, 21 years ago)

646
31:44.721 --> 31:45.800
I'm so disappointed in you.

647
31:46.281 --> 31:47.360
I paid for your education

648
31:47.481 --> 31:48.360
and trained you

649
31:48.521 --> 31:49.441
to manage my factory.

650
31:49.961 --> 31:51.521
And you repay my trust

651
31:51.761 --> 31:53.041
by embezzling factory funds?

652
31:53.400 --> 31:54.041
Sorry, Mr. Lu.

653
31:55.120 --> 31:55.921
I know I was wrong.

654
31:56.281 --> 31:57.520
I lent the money to a friend.

655
31:58.001 --> 31:58.521
I thought

656
31:59.640 --> 32:00.800
the money was sitting here,

657
32:00.865 --> 32:02.020
so lending it for a few days

658
32:02.320 --> 32:03.160
to earn some interest

659
32:03.160 --> 32:04.041
would be fine.

660
32:04.560 --> 32:05.536
Please give me a chance.

661
32:05.675 --> 32:06.423
Don't call the police.

662
32:06.481 --> 32:07.441
Let me make it right.

663
32:11.721 --> 32:12.281
I beg you!

664
32:12.961 --> 32:14.120
Deduct it from my salary.

665
32:14.120 --> 32:15.400
I won't sleep. I won't rest.

666
32:15.614 --> 32:16.843
I'll work overtime to pay it back!

667
32:27.961 --> 32:29.080
I'm the only one who knows

668
32:29.400 --> 32:30.481
about your embezzlement.

669
32:30.961 --> 32:31.360
Get

670
32:31.360 --> 32:32.441
the money back this week.

671
32:33.560 --> 32:34.160
Consider it

672
32:35.201 --> 32:35.921
a loan from me.

673
32:37.761 --> 32:38.481
Thank you, Mr. Lu.

674
32:41.400 --> 32:42.041
Get up.

675
32:46.320 --> 32:47.241
I watched you

676
32:47.241 --> 32:48.080
grow up.

677
32:48.961 --> 32:50.120
I know you're a good kid,

678
32:51.360 --> 32:53.281
but you're too clever for your own good.

679
32:53.761 --> 32:54.360
Money

680
32:55.320 --> 32:56.761
should be earned

681
32:56.761 --> 32:57.320
honestly.

682
32:58.320 --> 32:59.441
Earn it honestly?

683
33:01.001 --> 33:01.681
We lost

684
33:02.041 --> 33:03.441
all the company money

685
33:03.761 --> 33:04.961
in those investments.

686
33:04.961 --> 33:06.587
(Young Peng Cheng)

687
33:06.840 --> 33:07.721
How am I supposed

688
33:07.761 --> 33:09.001
to earn that money honestly

689
33:09.640 --> 33:10.911
to square things up this week?

690
33:12.800 --> 33:13.961
If they go to the police,

691
33:14.241 --> 33:15.160
we'll end up in prison.

692
33:17.241 --> 33:18.120
Is there a solution?

693
33:46.281 --> 33:47.241
Are you sure no cameras?

694
33:48.339 --> 33:49.386
If we're caught on camera,

695
33:49.560 --> 33:50.481
we're both finished.

696
33:50.640 --> 33:51.241
Don't worry.

697
33:51.840 --> 33:52.764
When I deliver goods,

698
33:53.241 --> 33:54.303
I always take this alley.

699
34:00.921 --> 34:01.441
Hold tight.

700
35:00.481 --> 35:01.640
We didn't kill him, did we?

701
35:03.841 --> 35:04.401
I only wanted

702
35:04.401 --> 35:05.481
to scare him with the car,

703
35:05.720 --> 35:06.760
just to make him hand over

704
35:06.801 --> 35:07.600
the IOU.

705
35:08.841 --> 35:10.120
I never meant to kill anyone!

706
35:11.280 --> 35:11.720
What now?

707
35:11.881 --> 35:12.240
Think...

708
35:12.240 --> 35:13.160
Think of a solution!

709
35:13.280 --> 35:14.481
Think of something! What now?

710
35:14.521 --> 35:15.640
Calm down. Calm down!

711
35:18.080 --> 35:18.881
Stop panicking.

712
35:19.921 --> 35:20.801
Find the IOU first.

713
35:27.321 --> 35:28.160
Right, the IOU.

714
35:53.120 --> 35:53.801
Is it this one?

715
35:58.403 --> 35:59.750
(IOU)

716
36:00.600 --> 36:01.041
Yes.

717
36:12.881 --> 36:13.280
Great!

718
36:14.841 --> 36:15.521
He's alive!

719
36:16.080 --> 36:16.720
He's alive!

720
36:17.441 --> 36:17.921
Call...

721
36:18.160 --> 36:18.921
Call an ambulance.

722
36:26.481 --> 36:27.521
He's lost so much blood.

723
36:29.120 --> 36:29.720
Do you think

724
36:29.720 --> 36:31.227
he'll last until the ambulance comes?

725
36:33.640 --> 36:35.521
Or do you want to turn yourself in

726
36:36.560 --> 36:38.041
and get hauled off by the cops?

727
37:32.361 --> 37:33.961
(Harry is out of danger)

728
37:34.280 --> 37:35.544
(and moved to a regular ward.)

729
37:42.813 --> 37:48.230
(Keep Quiet)

730
38:02.521 --> 38:03.240
Let me see Haoyu.

731
38:06.401 --> 38:07.120
Are you worthy?

732
38:07.401 --> 38:08.240
I'm his father.

733
38:09.178 --> 38:10.322
He doesn't want to see you.

734
38:11.401 --> 38:12.001
He's just upset

735
38:12.041 --> 38:13.160
that I didn't visit these days.

736
38:13.160 --> 38:13.841
Let me explain.

737
38:14.160 --> 38:15.548
I said he doesn't want to see you!

738
38:15.720 --> 38:16.160
Get lost!

739
38:16.441 --> 38:17.401
What are you doing?

740
38:18.280 --> 38:19.321
Haoyu is my son, too.

741
38:19.481 --> 38:20.240
I care about him!

742
38:20.680 --> 38:21.401
You care?

743
38:23.401 --> 38:24.560
When he ran into that fire,

744
38:24.720 --> 38:25.338
where were you?

745
38:25.560 --> 38:27.160
Checking whether Yu Meng was dead?

746
38:27.560 --> 38:28.362
What are you saying?

747
38:28.921 --> 38:30.401
You set that fire at the Yus', right?

748
38:32.240 --> 38:33.600
Okay, I'll let Wang know.

749
38:37.481 --> 38:38.001
Get out.

750
38:38.441 --> 38:39.280
Get out!

751
38:41.881 --> 38:42.560
Are you insane?

752
38:44.321 --> 38:45.521
I know you're upset,

753
38:45.815 --> 38:46.766
but if Hao Yu hears you

754
38:46.801 --> 38:48.240
say that, what's he going to think?

755
38:48.401 --> 38:49.680
Save your lies

756
38:49.720 --> 38:50.560
for someone else!

757
38:51.441 --> 38:52.120
Di Liren,

758
38:52.921 --> 38:53.881
it's been over 20 years.

759
38:53.881 --> 38:54.481
When you lie,

760
38:54.600 --> 38:55.521
I can tell instantly.

761
38:56.640 --> 38:58.200
Why should my son suffer

762
38:58.680 --> 38:59.720
for your sins?

763
39:00.521 --> 39:01.321
Get out of here!

764
39:01.429 --> 39:02.441
I don't want to see you again!

765
39:02.441 --> 39:03.441
My sins?

766
39:04.361 --> 39:05.080
I told you

767
39:05.160 --> 39:06.078
to keep an eye on him

768
39:06.200 --> 39:07.560
and keep him away from Yu Meng!

769
39:07.961 --> 39:08.760
Did you do that?

770
39:09.560 --> 39:10.321
I warned you

771
39:10.481 --> 39:11.361
just two days ago.

772
39:11.640 --> 39:12.640
If you had cared more,

773
39:12.961 --> 39:14.321
Haoyu wouldn't be suffering!

774
39:16.760 --> 39:17.680
It's on me. I knew

775
39:17.680 --> 39:18.560
you were only after

776
39:18.600 --> 39:19.321
shares and power.

777
39:19.961 --> 39:20.841
I foolishly thought

778
39:20.841 --> 39:21.481
you'd never

779
39:21.560 --> 39:22.841
hurt your own flesh and blood.

780
39:23.160 --> 39:23.640
I knew

781
39:23.760 --> 39:24.921
you'd lost your mind,

782
39:25.560 --> 39:26.841
yet not taking our son away.

783
39:27.361 --> 39:28.321
Get out of here!

784
39:29.921 --> 39:30.560
If you dare take

785
39:30.720 --> 39:31.921
another step into this room,

786
39:32.720 --> 39:34.041
I'll take you down with me!

787
39:40.600 --> 39:41.401
Get out!

788
39:41.720 --> 39:42.200
Get lost!

789
40:11.873 --> 40:14.175
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

790
40:14.921 --> 40:15.841
Don't come anymore.

791
40:16.441 --> 40:17.280
This is also

792
40:17.481 --> 40:18.280
for your sake.

793
40:18.801 --> 40:20.560
Once Meng looks into that money,

794
40:21.080 --> 40:22.401
you'll surely be dragged down.

795
40:22.720 --> 40:23.680
And now,

796
40:24.041 --> 40:24.841
this favor

797
40:25.760 --> 40:27.560
is enough for her to let you go for good.

798
40:27.881 --> 40:28.521
This time,

799
40:29.080 --> 40:30.160
I will protect you.

800
40:30.720 --> 40:31.760
Kang Long took new patents

801
40:31.760 --> 40:32.600
and the core team

802
40:32.801 --> 40:33.961
to join Yu Meng's team.

803
40:34.051 --> 40:34.720
(Resume)

804
40:34.720 --> 40:36.280
The company has suffered massive losses

805
40:36.280 --> 40:37.606
in talent, technology, and funds.

806
40:38.200 --> 40:39.441
I want to know the solution

807
40:39.801 --> 40:41.047
the Legal Department proposed.

808
40:41.080 --> 40:41.841
We recommend

809
40:41.881 --> 40:43.080
a lawsuit against Yu Meng,

810
40:43.401 --> 40:44.041
suing her

811
40:44.160 --> 40:45.680
for premeditated harm to the company.

812
40:47.401 --> 40:48.881
How is the divorce gift?

813
40:49.200 --> 40:49.841
Do you like it?

814
41:05.495 --> 41:10.364
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

815
41:12.848 --> 41:17.711
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

816
41:20.169 --> 41:25.014
♪The love that stumbled along♪

817
41:25.459 --> 41:31.961
♪Was just a quiet release♪

818
41:34.693 --> 41:41.646
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

819
41:42.196 --> 41:48.126
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

820
41:49.250 --> 41:56.481
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

821
41:56.784 --> 42:01.957
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

822
42:02.577 --> 42:14.045
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

823
42:16.545 --> 42:21.793
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

824
42:23.834 --> 42:29.269
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

825
42:31.091 --> 42:36.488
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

826
42:36.488 --> 42:45.133
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

827
42:45.609 --> 42:53.172
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

828
42:53.172 --> 42:59.018
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

829
42:59.018 --> 43:09.185
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
